/Title (This report documents the data exploration, quality checks, validation strategy, feature experiments, model selection, error analysis, final prediction pipeline, and the required December 2025 scenario forecast. The assessment instructions require a PDF/DOCX report describing the train/test validation and split approach and including the fixed December prediction chart. The 12,000-row validation set is an unlabeled prediction set; therefore, no local ground-truth score is claimed for those final predictions.)
