/Title (The posted_rate target is right-skewed. Its mean is $2,373.98, median is $2,030.76, standard deviation is $1,486.49, and maximum is $25,533.00. The 99th percentile is $5,972.83. This large upper tail was an important consideration when selecting the training objective. Key relationships Distance was by far the strongest simple numerical relationship with the target: its Pearson correlation with posted_rate was 0.9085. Weight, market_index, and quote_signal had much weaker linear correlations, while the geographic coordinates provided additional location information.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 339 0 R
